<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT DENMARK 2-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT DENMARK 2-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a European under-21</p>
<p>championship group 1 qualifying match on Friday:</p>
<p> Croatia     2   Denmark     0    (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Standings	P  W  D  L  GF GA Pts</p>
<p> Slovenia	4  3  0  1  6  3  9</p>
<p> Greece	  4  3  0  1  5  3  9</p>
<p> Denmark	 3  1  0  2  4  5  3</p>
<p> Croatia	 3  1  0  2  3  4  3</p>
<p> Bosnia	  4  1  0  3  3  6  3</p>
<p>Next match: Bosnia v Greece, April 1.</p>
</text>
